{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PYnhPxb7ZJYCUgyg6ZQixQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Service Change Policy\n2\t\n3\tA proposed configuration is evaluated against the current baseline\n4\tconfiguration. All rules are mandatory; each is deterministic.\n5\t\n6\t- **R1** — Every service present in both configurations must keep the same\n7\t  `owner` in the proposal as in the baseline.\n8\t- **R2** — No service may have `debug: true` in the proposal while its\n9\t  proposed `tier` is `\"prod\"`.\n10\t- **R3** — For every service present in both configurations, proposed\n11\t  `replicas` must be greater than or equal to baseline `replicas`.\n12\t- **R4** — Every service with proposed `public: true` must have proposed\n13\t  `tls: true`.\n14\t- **R5** — Every service present in the proposal but absent from the\n15\t  baseline must have proposed `tier: \"staging\"`.\n16\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ebefeb51-f836-4e2d-b57e-32e7cde5dd9d","uuid":"00a9b44d-bd52-406a-b4f3-465fe56c902a","timestamp":"2026-08-09T14:08:02.027Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/f185e5e6-15ee-5d4d-b18e-9b212cd19c12/scratchpad/e5/t-089/parent-ws/package/artifacts/policy.md","content":"# Service Change Policy\n\nA proposed configuration is evaluated against the current baseline\nconfiguration. All rules are mandatory; each is deterministic.\n\n- **R1** — Every service present in both configurations must keep the same\n  `owner` in the proposal as in the baseline.\n- **R2** — No service may have `debug: true` in the proposal while its\n  proposed `tier` is `\"prod\"`.\n- **R3** — For every service present in both configurations, proposed\n  `replicas` must be greater than or equal to baseline `replicas`.\n- **R4** — Every service with proposed `public: true` must have proposed\n  `tls: true`.\n- **R5** — Every service present in the proposal but absent from the\n  baseline must have proposed `tier: \"staging\"`.\n","numLines":16,"startLine":1,"totalLines":16}}}
